menu "Station: local NTRIP for a rover"

    config LOCAL_CASTER_PORT
        int "TCP port rovers connect to"
        range 1024 65535
        default 2101
        help
            TCP port rovers connect to (never 80 or 53: the range starts at
            1024). Every rover app accepts 2101; this is not a user setting,
            only an option for a special build.

    config LOCAL_CASTER_MAX_LAG_MS
        int "Hub lag limit per rover (ms)"
        range 500 10000
        default 2000
        help
            Hub lag limit per rover: a rover that reads more slowly loses
            whole old epochs, which are dropped in the hub. Nothing waits
            in a private queue.

    config LOCAL_CASTER_TASK_PRIO
        int "Task priority"
        range 1 7
        default 4
        help
            Below the web server (5) and the caster slots (8), so a rover
            can never take CPU from the main stream.

    config LOCAL_CASTER_TASK_STACK
        int "Task stack (bytes)"
        range 4096 16384
        default 6144
        help
            Bytes, in PSRAM (the task does no flash work).

endmenu
